            "review_title": "Review at Binh Minh",
            "review_text": "Dicko W\nSydney, Australia1 contribution\n0\nReal local Nha Trang cuisine.\nSep 2022\nThey say, \"if you want really good food then eat where a lot of locals eat!\" This restaurant lives up to that old quote.\nWe ordered five dishes and two drinks for USD$15-00! All good sized servings and served with a smile. No one was rushing us as some other places do. My Vietnamese wife also loved the food quality.\nWell worth a visit for real Nha Trang cuisine,\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 7, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
