            "review_title": "Review at Binh Minh",
            "review_text": "Chau N\nHanoi, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nThe best food I tried in Nha Trang\nAug 2014 • Family\nThis is a no fancy restaurant, simple and casual, but the foods are excellent. They also offered six kinds of sauces to go with the foods, and all the sauces are superb. Every food I tried here is just perfect. The price is also very good compared with other restaurants my family went to in Nha Trang. It seems to be a place the locals love to go to eat, as they recommended it to us. We went there again and again during the time we stayed in Nha Trang.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 14, 2014",
