            "review_title": "Review at Binh Minh",
            "review_text": "Uyennb\n2 contributions\n0\nBeyond expectation\nAug 2012\nReally really good Vietnamese food. Agreed with previous comment, very much like home cooking.\nWe were to have lunch at a fancy restaurant but it were reserved for a big tourist group. So we asked the taxi driver for another place and he recommended Binh Minh, saying that its the best Vietnamese restaurant to the locals. The restaurant looks very much like any other local one and full of local people. We were doubtful at first but then didnt regret trying it out. All tables are with clean table cloth, service is quick, food are very fresh and tasty. If you wanna try genuine vietnamese home cooking, I highly recommend Binh Minh. The restaurant should have higher ranking here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 19, 2013",
            "rating": 3.0,
