            "review_text": "panasia\nMontreal, Canada134 contributions\n0\nMom's cooking\nJan 2013\nVery good food, fresh, taste like vietnamese home cooking. Very reasonable price. We like the steamed whole fish with ginger and the fried fish with sweet sour sauce.\nClean dining room with tablecloth, also clean toilet. Near Dam market, so a little bit out of the backpacker area. We were so satisfied that we went back for a second time in two days.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 17, 2013",
